invariant: INV-45
file: src/sha3_inverted_lanes.h
catches: sha3_equiv_test
reason: invert_lanes leaves lane 17 as stored, so the inverted lanes form
  of the permutation starts and ends with five lanes inverted where its
  round expects six. The equivalence test runs that form on every
  machine, beside the plain form, and requires the reference's state.

--- old
    a[17] = ~a[17];
--- new
